interaction plot res x1 x3
title x2*x3
interaction plot res x2 x3
title x1*x2*x3
interaction plot res x1 x2 x3
end of multiplot
multiplot scale factor 1
multiplot corner coordinates
character x
character size
title
title
y1label
y1label displacement
major tic mark number
minor tic mark number
.
